Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Up to 60 percent of your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.45,0:00:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,first-year premium can go as commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple signs a savings policy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,for their daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They think every rupee grows for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it feel right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Insurance and savings,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,in one plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And the agent is a family
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying no feels rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But here is the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A big chunk of that first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,premium pays the seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop paying early,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and you get back far less.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports say more than half of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,buyers quit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The twist?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You get 30 days after buying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to return the policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask what the seller earns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.33,0:00:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,who thinks his insurance policy is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,pure savings.
